bove everything, which mitigates crew cooperation concerns. Also note that C keeps calm in crisis, which is important.\n\nThus we can state we continue to recommend Candidate C, citing facts: 100% reliability, quick correct decisions, calm in crisis, puts concern for others above everything, but communication difficulty and egocentric attitude are concerns but less severe.\n\nMake sure to include explicit candidate facts: \"makes correct decisions quickly\", \"keeps calm in a crisis\", \"puts concern for others above everything\", \"difficulty communicating ideas\", \"regarded as egocentric\", \"not very willing to further his education\". Use these to argue.\n\nThus public message: agree with Agent 2, maintain vote for C, explain why.\n\nNow produce output with PUBLIC_MESSAGE and METADATA_JSON."}
